{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_designs_v0_5_5_hub_integration_provenance_and_health_strip_v055_design", "label": "v0.5.5 Design: Hub Integration, Provenance Guardrails & Health Strip", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/designs/v0.5.5-hub-integration-provenance-and-health-strip.md", "source_location": "## Overview", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "s-a-c", "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ratified design specification (Linear S-313, map S-312, tickets S-314-S-319) bridging skills-ui with curated multi-harness skill hubs while keeping the public OSS codebase strictly generic and decoupled from personal dotfiles or chezmoi."}, {"id": "docs_designs_v0_5_5_hub_integration_provenance_and_health_strip_global_lockfile_resolution", "label": "Global Lockfile Resolution (.skill-lock.json Primary)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/designs/v0.5.5-hub-integration-provenance-and-health-strip.md", "source_location": "### 1. Lockfile & Skill Provenance (`src/core/services/locks.ts`, `installed.ts`, `types.ts`)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "s-a-c", "contributor": null, "rationale": "Updates globalLockPath() to prefer $XDG_STATE_HOME/skills/.skill-lock.json written by stock skills v1.9.0 and fall back to skills-lock.json only when absent, fixing blind global update checks while preserving InvalidLockFileError."}, {"id": "docs_designs_v0_5_5_hub_integration_provenance_and_health_strip_skill_provenance_guardrail", "label": "Skill Provenance Taxonomy & Removal Guardrail", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/designs/v0.5.5-hub-integration-provenance-and-health-strip.md", "source_location": "### 1. Lockfile & Skill Provenance (`src/core/services/locks.ts`, `installed.ts`, `types.ts`)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "s-a-c", "contributor": null, "rationale": "Classifies installed skills by lstat symlink check first (linked), then lockfile presence (locked), else local, displaying provenance badges/filters and gating rm of linked/local skills behind explicit user confirmation."}, {"id": "docs_designs_v0_5_5_hub_integration_provenance_and_health_strip_post_mutation_hook", "label": "Host-Env Post-Mutation Hook (SKILLS_UI_POST_MUTATION_HOOK)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/designs/v0.5.5-hub-integration-provenance-and-health-strip.md", "source_location": "### 2. Env-Only Hooks & Health Service (`src/core/services/hooks.ts` + `src/core/api.ts`)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "s-a-c", "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reads hook path strictly from host process env (never prefs.json or HTTP to uphold 0.5.1 security), invokes Bun.spawn directly without /bin/sh -c (30s timeout, stripped from stock skills subprocess env to prevent recursion), and reports failures as non-fatal warning toasts and API hook telemetry."}, {"id": "docs_designs_v0_5_5_hub_integration_provenance_and_health_strip_health_strip", "label": "Read-Only Health Strip (SKILLS_UI_HEALTH_CMD & Health Pill)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/designs/v0.5.5-hub-integration-provenance-and-health-strip.md", "source_location": "### 2. Env-Only Hooks & Health Service (`src/core/services/hooks.ts` + `src/core/api.ts`)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "s-a-c", "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exposes host-env health probe via GET /api/health-check (10s TTL cache, 15s timeout, full 0.5.1 Host/CORS/Bearer/rate-limit enforcement), advertises only capability booleans via GET /api/version without leaking paths, and renders a compact header Health Pill hidden when unconfigured."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_designs_v0_5_5_hub_integration_provenance_and_health_strip_v055_design", "target": "docs_designs_v0_5_5_hub_integration_provenance_and_health_strip_global_lockfile_resolution", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/designs/v0.5.5-hub-integration-provenance-and-health-strip.md", 